@startuml LocationProvider订阅状态图
' 赵冠钧 · 第二阶段设计 · LocationProvider 订阅状态
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> Idle

state Idle {
  Idle : 未订阅
  Idle : stop 幂等无副作用
}

state Starting {
  Starting : 检查权限/定位服务
}

state Running {
  Running : 入口：开始推送 samples
  Running : 内部：按间隔采样
}

state Failed {
  Failed : 入口：推送 LocationError
  Failed : PERMISSION_DENIED /
  Failed : SERVICE_DISABLED / UNKNOWN
}

state Stopping {
  Stopping : 释放平台监听
}

Idle --> Starting : start()
Starting --> Running : 授权且服务可用
Starting --> Failed : 拒绝或服务关闭
Running --> Failed : 运行中权限丢失/服务关闭
Running --> Stopping : stop() / dispose
Failed --> Starting : retry / start()
Failed --> Stopping : stop()
Stopping --> Idle : 释放完成

note right of Running
  StudyController 在 Running
  期间才 uploadSample
end note

note right of Failed
  对应界面 DEGRADED
  不假装采样成功
end note
@enduml
